7.2 User Earnings Flow
text
Earnings Received:
1. Add to wallet_balance_gbp
2. Check: wallet ≥ next tier price?
   YES → Auto-upgrade, deduct price
   NO → Continue
3. Check: this_month_earnings ≥ (monthly_fee × 110%)?
   YES → Deduct monthly_fee from wallet
   NO → Wait
4. Check: wallet > monthly_cap?
   YES → Move surplus to Poverty Fund
   NO → Keep in wallet
